<item><title>Court restores Senegal as Afcon 2025 champions</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/court-restores-senegal-as-afcon-2025-champions-142a21/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/court-restores-senegal-as-afcon-2025-champions-142a21/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>The arbitration panel overturned the decision that stripped Senegal of the title after its players left the field during the final against Morocco.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:16:09 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/court-restores-senegal-as-afcon-2025-champions-142a21/share.jpg" length="38628" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/court-restores-senegal-as-afcon-2025-champions-142a21/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Sports tribunal restores Senegal’s 1-0 Africa Cup final win</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/sports-tribunal-restores-senegal-s-1-0-africa-cup-final-win-dc0785/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/sports-tribunal-restores-senegal-s-1-0-africa-cup-final-win-dc0785/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>The court overturned a March ruling that had awarded Morocco a 3-0 victory by forfeit after Senegalese players briefly left the field.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:27:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" length="32606" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
